==About Olivia==
"Chief nurse of a renowned hospital."

== Story ==
After an operation from a childhood accident, Olivia developed a special abilityto heal and revive - with one miraculous touch, she can gently will the pain away and promote healing in injuries. Despite hertraumatic childhood, Olivia grew to become the most caring and compassionate among her peers. However, she has little social interaction outside Ford's safe zone and shies away from the world.

== Ablilty ==

=== Passive Ability (Healing Touch): ===
Increase healing effect by 30% and spread 90% of the user single-target healing amount to teammates within 20m range.

== Play style ==
Olivia's supportive ability pairs very well with other healing abilities like Jota, Leon or Ford to heal Nearby teammates with ease, Olivia should stick to teammates to make sure they heal when she does.

